      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Complications after coronary artery bypass grafting are myriad and are to a certain extent operator dependent. The investigators report 2 unusual cases of inadvertent aortocoronary fistula after coronary artery bypass grafting that escaped routine detection. In conclusion, the development of heart failure led to the detection of this rare complication."},
